==Introduction==

===Abstract===

This document extends the [[bip-0032.mediawiki|BIP 32]] extended key serialization format to include SPHINCS+ key material for quantum-insured Taproot addresses. Two new version prefixes, <code>qpub</code> and <code>qprv</code>, encode a standard BIP 32 extended key alongside a SPHINCS+ keypair. A watch-only wallet holding a <code>qpub</code> can derive quantum-insured Taproot addresses without access to any private key material.

